{"id":"event_marian2_02_s","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40125","label":"MARIA-n · Part 2"},"label":"The Queen and Her Companion: A","stage":null,"prev":"event_marian2_01_e","next":"event_marian2_02_e","speakers":{"doctormaria":"Doctor Maria","enikk_op_l":"Enikk"},"icons":{"doctormaria":"si_c9041_00_s","enikk_op_l":"si_c904_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_1","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_1","text":"Doctor Maria's room.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"SilverGun_LAB","bgArt":"silvergun_lab","image":null,"bgm":"event_bgm_maria-n_enikk","movie":null,"shown":["doctormaria"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_2","text":"Human cloning? That is beyond insane.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["enikk_op_l"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_3","text":"What even is No. 7? Is he really human?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_4","text":"Biologically, he is identical to a human.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_5","text":"He simply has several special functions.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_6","text":"Right. I understand that you somehow managed to clone a human.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_7","text":"Cloning wasn't impossible before, just entirely unethical.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_8","text":"But how do you get his memories to carry over?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_9","text":"A living human can't withstand NIMPH. The brain is completely destroyed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_10","text":"You were capable of it, were you not?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_11","text":"... Because I was \"raised\" that way. I was essentially made in order to push NIMPH compatibility to its limits.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_12","text":"But I'm the only successful case. And even then, it was only possible because I was an anomaly with overwhelmingly high brain function.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_13","text":"Doctor Alva made you that way, in hopes you would go down the same path she did.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_14","text":"She feared that her knowledge would disappear.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_15","text":"She backed up her knowledge using NIMPH, an unknown technology at the time, and wished to pass it directly to you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_16","text":"The result of that is you, Doctor Maria.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_17","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_18","text":"However, Doctor Alva became the one who drove humanity to the brink of extinction,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_19","text":"and you, her daughter and the inheritor of her knowledge, could not escape suspicion either.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_20","text":"You were ordered to conduct your research alone in a place like this, with no one around.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_21","text":"\"You are to carry out research that will assure humanity's victory, and are not to return to the Ark until you have produced results.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_22","text":"You have effectively been exiled.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_23","text":"Thank you. That was a delightful trip down memory lane.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_24","text":"Now, are you going to answer my question about how No. 7's memories carry over?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_25","text":"There is an external device on his body fitted with NIMPH that backs up his memories.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_26","text":"The NIMPH only activates and acts upon the brain at the moment of recall.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_27","text":"... I tried that myself. It's effective for short periods, but as the size of the NIMPH's data grows, meaning the number of memories,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_28","text":"the burden on the brain grows with it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_29","text":"You still end up damaging the brain.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_30","text":"I know.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_31","text":"... I know this is hypocritical of me to say, but you're just treating life like it's expendable.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_32","text":"It is for humanity's future.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_33","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_34","text":"Why did you make him? No. 7.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_35","text":"What does he have to do with Marian?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_36","text":"You call her Marian.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_37","text":"... Just answer me. You only tried No. 1 through 6 once each. Why do you keep remaking No. 7?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_38","text":"What, because he's a good person and seems like he'll help Marian? That can't be it. You would never use something like that as your selection criteria.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_39","text":"What are you planning?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_40","text":"That is classified.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_41","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_42","text":"Want to hear my theory?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_43","text":"If you wish.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_44","text":"The reason you send Marian out corrupted isn't to turn her into a Heretic.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_45","text":"Investigating the Heretic production process? That doesn't make sense.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_46","text":"The moment she's corrupted, her NIMPH breaks and becomes impossible to observe.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_47","text":"So then why go through the trouble of implanting corruption and sending her up to the surface?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_48","text":"I'm sure you actually do want to turn her into a Heretic,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_49","text":"but the actual goal is something greater than even that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_50","text":"A Queen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_51","text":"I don't know how you came to the idea of creating a Queen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_52","text":"It could be the delusion of an AI gone insane,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_53","text":"or it could be because there's some external factor at play.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_54","text":"In any case, you're trying to use Marian to make a Queen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_55","text":"Which naturally suggests the Queen is currently absent from the surface.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_56","text":"And that leads us to your reasons for No. 7.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_57","text":"If Marian were to become a Queen,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_58","text":"then you must've put No. 7 by her side so you can use him for something.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_59","text":"I would like to hear your theory on what that something is.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_60","text":"Maybe you implanted him with some sort of self-destruct device that only reacts to the Queen, or...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_61","text":"That is correct.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_62","text":"... What?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_63","text":"Are you aware of the gene?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"doctormaria","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_64","text":"... What do you mean?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_65","text":"I am referring to using the Queen's own heart to kill her,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_marian2_02_s_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_marian2_02_s_66","text":"the final possibility for humanity's salvation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}